Data Content: 1E 92 DD 34 BF 3E 19 A1 D1 BE 2E 60 6D 54 EE 17 09 2A 2C A3 C5 80 8B 02 6A 94 C8 5C B5 BA 56 B2
# Block Security Status: 01 = locked, 00 = not locked
